      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "容易推出："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\sin(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)=\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\cos\\alpha+\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\sin\\alpha↵=1\\cdot\\cos\\alpha+0\\cdot\\sin\\alpha=\\cos\\alpha$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\cos(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)=\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\cos\\alpha-\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\sin\\alpha↵=0\\cdot\\cos\\alpha-1\\cdot\\sin\\alpha=-\\sin\\alpha$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（在八年级几何教材第102小节里给出了另一种证明",
        "方法.)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用加法定理，同样可以得出对于角度 $\\pi+\\alpha$ 和 $\\frac{3\\pi}{2}+\\alpha$ 的",
        "诱导公式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "然而，也可以用下面的方式处理："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\sin(\\pi+\\alpha)=\\sin[\\frac{\\pi}{2}+(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)]↵=\\cos(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)=-\\sin\\alpha$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\cos(\\pi+\\alpha)=\\cos[\\frac{\\pi}{2}+(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)]↵=-\\sin(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)=-\\cos\\alpha$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\sin(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)=\\sin[\\pi+(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)]↵=-\\sin(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)=-\\cos\\alpha$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\cos(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)=\\cos[\\pi+(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)]↵=-\\cos(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha)=-(-\\sin\\alpha)=\\sin\\alpha$."
      ]
    },
